[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
markpdf-web is the HTTP render API (POST /render) and playground.

Enable it in /etc/rc.conf:

  markpdf_enable="YES"

Optional knobs (defaults shown):

  markpdf_user="www"
  markpdf_port="3000"
  markpdf_opts=""       # extra args, e.g. "--fontdir /path/to/fonts"

Custom fonts: markpdf-web renders with fonts auto-scanned from
/usr/share/fonts, /usr/local/share/fonts, and $HOME/.local/share/fonts.
To use your own faces (e.g. the MB Type Advocate, Valkyrie and
Triplicate families), point markpdf_opts at a fontdir holding the
TrueType (.ttf) files, which are then matched by their internal family
name in CSS.
EOM
}
]
